<header>
  <div class="header-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="classification">⬛ EXPLOSIVE SAFETY — COGNITIVE TRAINING MODULE 04</div>
      <h1>DRIFT<span>COGNITION</span></h1>
      <p class="header-sub">Sensing invisible degradation before it becomes a headline</p>
    </div>
    <div class="header-meta">
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>MODULE</strong>DC-04</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>TARGET</strong>Warrants &amp; Safety Officers</div>
      <div class="meta-item"><strong>TIMEFRAME</strong>2030–2050 Operations</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="doctrine">
  <div class="doctrine-quote">
    "Systems fail slowly, then all at once."
  </div>
</div>

<main>

  <!-- FOUR LAYERS -->

  <div class="section-label">FOUR COGNITIVE LAYERS</div>

  <div class="layers-grid">

```
<div class="layer-card" data-num="01">
  <div class="layer-tag">Layer 01 — Entry Detection</div>
  <div class="layer-title">Drift Awareness</div>
  <div class="layer-sub">"This used to be different."</div>
  <ul class="layer-list">
    <li>Shortcuts become normal</li>
    <li>Documentation becomes ritual</li>
    <li>Inspections become predictable</li>
    <li>Contractors become comfortable</li>
    <li>"Temporary" becomes permanent</li>
    <li>Leadership turnover erases memory</li>
    <li>Assumptions replace verification</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="layer-card" data-num="02">
  <div class="layer-tag">Layer 02 — Pattern Recognition</div>
  <div class="layer-title">Drift Pattern Recognition</div>
  <div class="layer-sub">"I've seen this movie before."</div>
  <ul class="layer-list">
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Inspection Drift</strong> — fewer eyes, fewer questions</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Contractor Drift</strong> — selective transparency</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Storage Drift</strong> — undocumented accumulation</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Leadership Drift</strong> — new leaders, old hazards</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Cultural Drift</strong> — "we've always done it this way"</li>
    <li><strong style="color:var(--warn)">Documentation Drift</strong> — copy-paste risk assessments</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="layer-card" data-num="03">
  <div class="layer-tag">Layer 03 — Compounding Effects</div>
  <div class="layer-title">Drift Accumulation</div>
  <div class="layer-sub">"One deviation is survivable. Ten are lethal."</div>
  <ul class="layer-list">
    <li>One shortcut becomes two</li>
    <li>Two become four</li>
    <li>Four become the new normal</li>
    <li>Deviations compound exponentially</li>
    <li>How Minden and Tennessee happened</li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="layer-card" data-num="04">
  <div class="layer-tag">Layer 04 — Anticipatory Safety</div>
  <div class="layer-title">Consequence Cognition</div>
  <div class="layer-sub">"If this continues, someone dies."</div>
  <ul class="layer-list">
    <li>Model second- and third-order effects</li>
    <li>Map cascading failures</li>
    <li>Identify hidden dependencies</li>
    <li>Anticipate contractor deception</li>
    <li>Predict inspection blind spots</li>
    <li>Surface leadership ignorance before catastrophe</li>
  </ul>
</div>
```

  </div>

  <!-- DRIFT ACCUMULATION CHAIN -->

  <div class="section-label">DRIFT ACCUMULATION — LIVE EXAMPLE</div>
  <div class="accum-section">
    <div style="font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:0.2em;margin-bottom:8px;">CASE: UNINSPECTED BUILDING PATHWAY TO CATASTROPHE</div>
    <div class="accum-chain">
      <div class="chain-item">
        <div class="chain-dot">1×</div>
        <div class="chain-body">
          <div class="chain-label">DEVIATION — INITIAL EVENT</div>
          <div class="chain-text">A building goes uninspected once due to schedule pressure</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="chain-arrow">↓ normalizes</span>
      <div class="chain-item">
        <div class="chain-dot">2×</div>
        <div class="chain-body">
          <div class="chain-label">NORMALIZATION — DRIFT PHASE</div>
          <div class="chain-text">That building becomes "low priority" — it doesn't need inspection</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="chain-arrow">↓ institutionalizes</span>
      <div class="chain-item">
        <div class="chain-dot">4×</div>
        <div class="chain-body">
          <div class="chain-label">INSTITUTIONALIZATION — DOCTRINE PHASE</div>
          <div class="chain-text">Successive leaders inherit the assumption: "not required"</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="chain-arrow">↓ collapses</span>
      <div class="chain-item">
        <div class="chain-dot" style="font-size:14px;">⚡</div>
        <div class="chain-body">
          <div class="chain-label">CATASTROPHE — TERMINAL EVENT</div>
          <div class="chain-text">Never inspected. Contains unknown hazard. Detonation. Casualties.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- DRIFT LOOP -->

  <div class="section-label">THE DRIFT COGNITION LOOP</div>
  <div class="loop-section">
    <div class="loop-stages">
      <div class="loop-stage stage-1">
        <div class="stage-num">STAGE 01</div>
        <div class="stage-name">Deviation</div>
        <div class="stage-desc">A shortcut or assumption is introduced</div>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-stage stage-2">
        <div class="stage-num">STAGE 02</div>
        <div class="stage-name">Normalization</div>
        <div class="stage-desc">"This is fine" — repeated without challenge</div>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-stage stage-3">
        <div class="stage-num">STAGE 03</div>
        <div class="stage-name">Institutional­ization</div>
        <div class="stage-desc">"This is how we do it" — becomes doctrine</div>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-stage stage-4">
        <div class="stage-num">STAGE 04</div>
        <div class="stage-name">Blindness</div>
        <div class="stage-desc">No one remembers the original standard</div>
      </div>
      <div class="loop-stage stage-5">
        <div class="stage-num">STAGE 05</div>
        <div class="stage-name">☠ Catastrophe</div>
        <div class="stage-desc">System collapses. Event occurs.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="interrupt-zone">
      <div class="interrupt-label">▶ INTERRUPT WINDOW</div>
      <div class="interrupt-text">Doctrine requires leaders to interrupt at <strong style="color:var(--green)">Stage 1 or 2</strong> — before normalization locks in. After Stage 3, drift becomes self-concealing. After Stage 4, the hazard is invisible to new leadership. Stage 5 is too late.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- RED FLAGS -->

  <div class="section-label">DRIFT RED FLAGS — AUDIBLE SIGNATURES</div>
  <div class="redflags-grid">
    <div class="redflag">
      <div class="redflag-quote">"We don't need to inspect that building."</div>
      <div class="redflag-type">INSPECTION DRIFT / NORMALIZATION</div>
    </div>
    <div class="redflag">
      <div class="redflag-quote">"The contractor said it's empty."</div>
      <div class="redflag-type">CONTRACTOR DRIFT / UNVERIFIED CLAIM</div>
    </div>
    <div class="redflag">
      <div class="redflag-quote">"We've never had a problem there."</div>
      <div class="redflag-type">SURVIVORSHIP BIAS / INSTITUTIONAL BLINDNESS</div>
    </div>
    <div class="redflag">
      <div class="redflag-quote">"We don't have time for that."</div>
